---
import { catalogueHref } from "../catalogue-manifest.js";
const href = (path: string) => catalogueHref(path, import.meta.env.BASE_URL);
---

<section id="browser-companion" class="gw-suite-screen-plate" data-catalogue-section data-section-label="Companion">
  <header class="gw-suite-plate-heading"><div><p>Side panel and compact popup</p><h2>Capture, inspect, review, and open—never a miniature desktop.</h2></div><span>The current page and exact target context remain visible.</span></header>
  <div class="gw-suite-companion-stage">
    <section class="gw-suite-host-page" aria-label="Simulated current page"><header><strong>Hara</strong><nav><span>Learn</span><span>Docs</span><span>Packages</span></nav></header><main><small>APPLICATION MODEL</small><h3>Portable values and explicit capabilities.</h3><p>Applications describe work while providers decide how named effects cross a boundary.</p><pre><code>{`{:op :browser/capture
 :target "space/open-distribution"
 :include :current-page
 :exclude [:credentials :history]}`}</code></pre><section><strong>Source-backed application contracts</strong><span>4,283 words · exact revision available</span></section></main></section>
    <aside class="gw-suite-side-panel" aria-label="Spaces browser companion"><header><div><span class="gw-suite-app-mark">SP</span><span><strong>Spaces</strong><small>Current page companion</small></span></div><span data-state="observed">Connected</span></header><nav><span class="is-active">Page</span><span>Handoff</span><span>Activity</span></nav><div class="gw-suite-panel-scroll"><section class="gw-suite-current-page"><small>Current page</small><strong>Hara application model</strong><span>hara-lang.org/docs/…</span><em>Not yet captured</em></section><section><p>Capture into</p><button type="button" disabled><span class="gw-suite-app-mark">SP</span><span><strong>Open distribution</strong><small>space/open-distribution</small></span><b>Exact target</b></button><dl><div><dt>Included</dt><dd>Current page · title · canonical URL · visible article</dd></div><div><dt>Excluded</dt><dd>Cookies · credentials · browser history · other tabs</dd></div></dl><span class="gw-suite-static-action">Capture specimen · no browser command connected</span></section><section><p>Provenance preview</p><dl><div><dt>Revision</dt><dd>Observed now · not verified</dd></div><div><dt>Anchor</dt><dd>Article body · lines pending extraction</dd></div><div><dt>Digest</dt><dd>Written only after exact capture</dd></div></dl></section><section class="gw-suite-panel-handoff"><p>Prepare Flow handoff</p><strong>Ask Release 24 to verify the capability claim.</strong><small>Would include this exact source and the selected Space question. It would not grant Space membership or publishing authority.</small><a href={href("/v2/applications/greenways-suite/handoff/")}>Review specimen →</a></section></div><footer><a href={href("/v2/applications/greenways-suite/desktop/")}>Open in Spaces</a><span>Browser context only</span></footer></aside>
    <aside class="gw-suite-popup" aria-label="Compact Greenways launcher"><header><span class="gw-suite-app-mark">GW</span><div><strong>Greenways</strong><small>Current context</small></div><span data-state="observed">Ready</span></header><section><div><small>Current application</small><strong>Spaces</strong></div><div><small>Target</small><strong>Open distribution</strong></div></section><nav><a href={href("/v2/applications/greenways-suite/companion/")}><span>SP</span><strong>Open side panel</strong></a><a href={href("/v2/applications/greenways-suite/desktop/")}><span>↗</span><strong>Open Spaces</strong></a><button type="button" disabled><span>+</span><strong>Capture current page</strong></button></nav><footer><span>1 approval</span><span>Flow project active</span><small>No editing here</small></footer></aside>
  </div>
</section>
